3. Document synchronous validation, one-shot greeting-only ownership, stop-before-pre-roll ordering, the 0–500 ms bounded pre-roll contract, normal/Skip buffer discard, runtime fallback to the old gate, asset deployment, and unchanged post-greeting OpenAI server-VAD behavior.
