5. State the acoustic uncertainty plainly: locally accepted audio may be playback echo or noise; requested AEC/NS/AGC and mock tests do not prove self-echo rejection, VAD accuracy, first-phoneme retention, or latency. Keep Skip greeting as the supported deterministic escape hatch.
